# ArduPlane Parameters - GPS Failure EKF Gate 300 / Glitch Radius 0 Envelope
# Apply after config/vehicles/plane_base.parm and config/overlays/plane_gps.parm.
#
# Purpose: envelope comparison for GPS failure behavior. This intentionally
# sets EK3_GLITCH_RAD to 0 and pins both position and velocity innovation gates
# to 300 for a named experiment. It is not the default GPS failure overlay.

EK3_GLITCH_RAD 0
EK3_POS_I_GATE 300
EK3_VEL_I_GATE 300
